<view class="group-page">
  <text class="g-title">约定一条学习底线</text><text class="g-sub g-gap-sm">长期同行，从每天可以做到的一点开始。</text>
  <view class="g-card g-gap"><text class="g-label first-label">小组名称</text><input class="g-input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="{{rules.nameMax}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：2027 省考坚持组" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text class="g-label">一起学习什么</text><input class="g-input" value="{{studyTopic}}" maxlength="{{rules.topicMax}}" data-key="studyTopic" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：行测综合、资料分析或自定义" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text class="g-label">每日学习底线</text><view class="g-actions"><button class="g-button g-secondary {{baselineType === 'duration' ? 'type-selected' : ''}}" data-type="duration" bindtap="onType" disabled="{{busy}}">时长型</button><button class="g-button g-secondary {{baselineType === 'quantity' ? 'type-selected' : ''}}" data-type="quantity" bindtap="onType" disabled="{{busy}}">数量型</button></view><view class="g-row g-gap-sm"><input class="g-input baseline-input" type="number" value="{{baselineValue}}" maxlength="6" data-key="baselineValue" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="每日底线数值" /><text wx:if="{{baselineType === 'duration'}}">分钟</text><picker wx:else range="{{units}}" value="{{unitIndex}}" bindchange="onUnit" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="unit-picker">{{units[unitIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><text class="g-sub g-gap-sm">创建后，底线类型、数值与单位锁定。</text></view>
  <view class="g-card"><text class="g-label first-label">你的组内称呼</text><input class="g-input" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="{{rules.nicknameMax}}" data-key="nickname" bindinput="input" placeholder="让伙伴认出你" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text class="g-sub g-gap-sm">称呼保存于本轮契约，对同组成员可见。使用内置头像，不上传本机头像昵称。</text></view>
  <view class="g-card"><text class="g-heading">共同接受的学习契约</text><text wx:for="{{contract}}" wx:key="*this" class="contract-line">{{index + 1}}. {{item}}</text></view>
  <checkbox-group bindchange="onAgree"><label class="g-check"><checkbox value="accept" checked="{{accepted}}" color="#4D785B" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text>我已阅读并接受学习契约，同意组内展示我的契约记录。</text></label></checkbox-group>
  <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="g-error">{{error}}</text><button class="g-button" bindtap="onSubmit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !accepted}}">接受契约并创建</button>
</view>
